      <div>
        <p>The V Spot Network is written and produced by Vinny O'Brien: 15+ years as an ecommerce operator (eBay, Arnotts), consultant to $100M+ brands across Ireland, the UK, EU, and North America, and founder of Vinny and Co Consulting.</p>
        <p>The house position: technology should amplify empathy, not just strip out friction. Some friction is the product. This gets argued at length in the essays and at slightly less length on the shows.</p>
        <p>The house frameworks: Friction as Currency, the THOUGHT/COMMERCIAL grid, and a cross-Atlantic lens that reads EU commerce through a North American frame and vice versa. Based in Tralee, County Kerry. Frequently in New York. Permanently between time zones.</p>
        <p>Vinny is a public speaker and available for events worldwide, conference lanyards a speciality.</p>
        <p class="muted">Consulting enquiries: <a href="https://vinnyandco.com">vinnyandco.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
